              "id": 17580090,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 140.0\n\n**Preconditions:**\nClean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://claude.ai/artifacts/inspiration/0e6f226e-70b0-418d-a03c-77ba65e4ba14\n2. Observe\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe page is loading correctly\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe page is not loading correctly\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/166104",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 140.0\n\n**Preconditions:**\nClean profile\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Navigate to: https://claude.ai/artifacts/inspiration/0e6f226e-70b0-418d-a03c-77ba65e4ba14\n2. Observe\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nThe page is loading correctly\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nThe page is not loading correctly\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/166104",
              "time": "2025-07-14T09:12:02Z"
            },
            {
